# Tilda IP avoidance (mandatory)

Full registry: `../_shared/TILDA-IP-TRAPS.md` (hub copy).

## Never ship in production / Astro repos
- Any `tilda-*.js` / `tilda-*.css` or copies of export `js/` `css/`
- CDN: `tildacdn.com`, `neo.tildacdn`, `ws.tildacdn`, `tilda.cc`, `tilda.ws`
- DOM: `data-tilda-*`, `formskey`, `.t-records`, `.t-rec`, Zero Block `t396` / `tn-atom`
- Branding: `tildacopy*.png`, footer "Made on Tilda"
- Icon pack: `lib__icons__tilda__*`
- Tilda Stats / cart / forms widgets

## Allowed from Tilda export
- Customer **text**, **URLs**, **meta**, structure as a checklist
- Customer-owned images/video after rights check (rename off `tild…` before prod when possible)
- Visual reference only — **rebuild** in Astro + Tailwind

## Workflow
1. Read content from `_tilda-references/` 
2. Implement new components (no paste of Tilda HTML blocks)
3. Run `npm run scan:ip` before PR/deploy
4. Stock photos still need human approval (separate from Tilda software IP)